   },
   "source": [
    "- Let's begin analyzing the results by plotting the DPO loss:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 51,
   "id": "8ddcc66f-cd7c-4f46-96ea-af919ea1a199",
   "metadata": {
